.TH man 1 "2026-06-08" "0.18.2" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
/inputwin

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Move the input window.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
/inputwin up

.LP
/inputwin down

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBup\fR
.RS 4
Move the input window up the screen.
.RE
.PP
\fBdown\fR
.RS 4
Move the input window down the screen.
.RE
